       readability for no benefit. */
    width: 100%;
    /* Same value on all three cards, not each one's own content height —
       Events/Research/Marketing's descriptions aren't quite the same
       length, and letting the card shrink-wrap its content would make
       the sliver offsets (the whole point of the 12px stagger) look like
       a layout accident instead of a deliberate rhythm. Measured against
       the tallest of the three at the widths this was verified at
       (800px and 1200px viewport heights); see CLAUDE.md for the figure. */
    min-height: var(--card-min-height);
    padding: 2.5rem;
